---

Reference physiology (tissue volumes, blood flows) derives from Brown et al.
(1997) and ICRP Publication 89. Caffeine drug parameters, tissue composition,
and the observed plasma profiles used for validation derive from the Open
Systems Pharmacology (OSP) caffeine model and the Fluvoxamine-Caffeine-DDI
project (Britz et al. 2019), which carry their own OSP license. Those third-party
resources are NOT redistributed here (see literature/DOWNLOADS.md); only
provenance-tagged parameter values extracted from them are included. Please cite
the original sources.
